\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-e2)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">液量与地层参数</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">应力差及约束</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">独立工况拆分</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">双目标分别拟合</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">双输出岭回归</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">半长半高米为单位</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">训练平均几何</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">固定均值轮廓</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">几何关系读清楚？补导流产能证据</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">检查同尺与范围</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">几何不直接等于产能</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">二维椭圆投影</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">完整长高均为两倍</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">独立轮廓评价</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">半长半高误差及交并比</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><h3>逐步图册（与独立演示相同）</h3><h4>图 F1｜定义液量和地层条件</h4><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 F1：定义液量和地层条件的动作、产物和检查点。\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"300\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#254755\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"21\">步骤 1｜定义液量和地层条件</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"60\" width=\"710\" height=\"67\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"16\">动作：输入注入液量、应力差和层间约束指数，二维裂缝采用固定井筒中心、水平半</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"16\">长L与垂直半高H描述。</text><path d=\"M380 132V158\" stroke=\"#247e85\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"151\" font-size=\"19\">↓</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"18\">产物：当前工况三项输入</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"16\">检查：约束指数为教学无量纲参数</text></g></svg><figcaption>图 F1：定义液量和地层条件的动作、产物和检查点。</figcaption></figure><h4>图 F2｜学习半长与半高</h4><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 F2：学习半长与半高的动作、产物和检查点。\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"300\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#254755\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"21\">步骤 2｜学习半长与半高</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"60\" width=\"710\" height=\"67\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"16\">动作：120个训练工况分别拟合L和H，使用液量、应力、约束及交互项；40个</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"16\">留出工况整组保留评价。</text><path d=\"M380 132V158\" stroke=\"#247e85\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"151\" font-size=\"19\">↓</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"18\">产物：冻结的双输出岭回归</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"16\">检查：当前查询不使用参考裂缝尺寸</text></g></svg><figcaption>图 F2：学习半长与半高的动作、产物和检查点。</figcaption></figure><h4>图 F3｜由参数重建椭圆</h4><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 F3：由参数重建椭圆的动作、产物和检查点。\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"300\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#254755\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"21\">步骤 3｜由参数重建椭圆</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"60\" width=\"710\" height=\"67\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"16\">动作：将预测L、H转为椭圆轮廓。横纵轴保持同一像素比例，防止改变绘图比例后</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"16\">看起来像裂缝变长；训练平均几何用虚线叠加。</text><path d=\"M380 132V158\" stroke=\"#247e85\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"151\" font-size=\"19\">↓</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"18\">产物：当前椭圆和均值轮廓</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"16\">检查：形态变化来自参数预测，不能由绘图装饰捏造</text></g></svg><figcaption>图 F3：由参数重建椭圆的动作、产物和检查点。</figcaption></figure><h4>图 F4｜独立工况比较轮廓</h4><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 F4：独立工况比较轮廓的动作、产物和检查点。\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"300\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#254755\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"21\">步骤 4｜独立工况比较轮廓</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"60\" width=\"710\" height=\"67\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"16\">动作：在独立40工况计算L/H平均绝对误差，并以720个角度数值积分求同中</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"16\">心椭圆的交并比。当前自由查询不显示虚构参考轮廓。</text><path d=\"M380 132V158\" stroke=\"#247e85\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"151\" font-size=\"19\">↓</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"18\">产物：几何参数误差与轮廓IoU</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"16\">检查：二维几何不提供分叉、连通性或三维传播结论</text></g></svg><figcaption>图 F4：独立工况比较轮廓的动作、产物和检查点。</figcaption></figure>"
      }
    },
